      "paragraphs": [
        "The Points Guy's comparison weighs Capital One Spark Cash Plus against Chase Ink Business Cash, framing the choice around how much a business spends. Per the publisher, Spark Cash Plus suits higher business spending, whereas Ink Business Cash is characterized by up to 5% back and the absence of an annual fee.",
